the great sage Ruci; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 tasy\'e4m}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash in her; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 aj\'e9janat}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash gave birth; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 mithunam}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash couple; }{
