, can also be considered the Lord of the universe. Similarly, K\'f1\'e9rodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi\'f1\'ebu, who is the Supersoul of all living entities, can also be considered the Lord of the universe. Then, under the order of K\'f1\'e9rodaka\'e7\'e4y\'e9 Vi
\'f1\'ebu, the Vi\'f1\'ebu form within this universe, Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7iva can also be accepted as the lords of the universe. Vi\'f1\'ebu is the Lord of the universe because He is its maintainer. 
