rance. Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu takes charge of persons who are advanced K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious Vai\'f1\'ebavas, and Lord Brahm\'e4 takes charge of persons who are very much attached to material activities, but Lord \'c7
iva is so kind that he takes charge of persons who are in gross ignorance and whose behavior is lower that that of the animals. Therefore Lord \'c7iva is especially called auspicious.
