 that in the Kali-yuga, in the body of a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  he would preach the M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid16673845 \'e9}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 philosophy. Thus it is generally found that the worshipers of Lord \'c7iva are M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 followers. Lord \'c7iva himself says, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4v\'e4dam asac-ch\'e4stram.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Asat-\'e7\'e4stra,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  as explained here, means the doctrine of M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid16673845 \'e9}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  impersonalism, or becoming one with the Supreme. Bh
\'e5gu Muni cursed that persons who worshiped Lord \'c7iva would become followers of this M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid16673845 \'e9}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 asat-\'e7\'e4stra. }{
\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628 It is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 asat-\'e7\'e4stra }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628 because the }{\cf1\insrsid11288628 M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid16673845 \'e9}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 doctrine}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  attempts to establish that the Supreme Personality of Godhead is impersonal. Besides that, among the worshipers of Lord \'c7iva there is a section who live a devilish life. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh
\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 N\'e4rada-pa\'efcar\'e4tra}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  are authorized scriptures that are considered }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 sat-\'e7\'e4stra,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
