 only would they be degraded as atheists because of his curse, but they had already fallen to the standard of atheism because they had blasphemed the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 which are the source of human civilization. Human civilization is based on the qualitative divisions of social order, namely the intelligent class, the martial class, the productive class and the laborer class. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  provide the right direction for advancing in spiritual cultivation and economic development and regulating the principle of sense grat
ification, so that ultimately one may be liberated from material contamination to his real state of spiritual identification (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 aha\'e0 brahm\'e4smi}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
). As long as one is in the contamination of material existence, he changes bodies from the aquatics up to the position of Brahm\'e4, but the human form of life is the highest perfectional life in the material world. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 
Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  give direction how to elevate oneself in the next life, so the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  are the mother for such instructions, and the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  or persons who are in knowledge of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  are the father. Thus if one blasphemes the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  and }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  naturally one goes down to the status of atheism. The exact word used in Sanskrit is }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 n\'e4stika,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 which means one who does not believe in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  but manufactures some concocted system of religion. \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4
prabhu has said that the followers of the Buddhist system of religion are }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 n\'e4stikas.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  In order to establish his doctrine of nonviolence, Lord Buddha flatly refused to believe in the }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  and thus, later on, \'c7a\'eckar\'e4c\'e4rya stopped this system of religion in India and forced it to go outside India. Here it is stated, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 brahma ca br\'e4hma\'eb
\'e4n.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Brahma}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  means the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vedas.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Aha\'e0 brahm\'e4smi}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 means "I am in full knowledge." The Vedic assertion is that one should think that he is Brahman, for actually he is Brahman. If }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 brahman,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 or the Vedic spiritual science is condemned, and the masters of the spiritual science, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 br\'e4hma\'ebas,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  are condemned, then where does human civilization stand? Bh\'e5
gu Muni says, "It is not due to my cursing that you shall become atheists; you are already situated in the principle of atheism. Therefore you are condemned."
\par 
