 stalwart personalities who generate the entire population of the world are interested in satisfying the Supreme Personality of Godhead by offering sacrifices. The Lord also says in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
