\'efa,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  Lord \'c7iva was in meditation and might not have seen Dak\'f1a enter, but Dak\'f1a took the opportunity to curse him because he had maintained an envious attitude towards Lord \'c7
iva for a long time. Those who are actually self-realized see every individual body as a temple of the Supreme Personality of Godhead because the Supreme Personality of Godhead, in His Param\'e4tm\'e4 feature, is residing in everyone's body.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11288628 
