 who are envious of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. When K\'e5\'f1\'eba says, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 manman\'e4 bhava mad-bhakta\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  \emdash "Always think of Me, become My devotee, and surrender unto Me"\emdash 
