sudeva in pure K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness is always pure consciousness, and in that consciousness the Supreme Personality of Godhead, known as V\'e4sudeva, is revealed without any covering.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid11288628\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
