 among the living entities within this material world, his name, \'c7iva, is very auspicious for persons who identify the body with the soul. If such persons take shelter of Lord \'c7
iva, gradually they will understand that they are not the material body but are spirit soul. }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid5718203 \'c7iva}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  means }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 ma\'ecgala,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
