 because under their protection there are hundreds and thousands of saintly persons who sanctify the sacred places of pilgrimage. \'c7r\'e9la Narottamad\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4kur, a great }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'e4c\'e4rya}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 of the Gau\'f2\'e9ya Vai\'f1\'ebava Samprad\'e4ya, advises us not to travel to different places of pilgrimage. Undoubtedly, it is troublesome to go from one place to another, but one who is intelligent can 
take shelter of the lotus feet of Govinda and thereby be automatically sanctified as the result of his pilgrimage. Anyone who is fixed in the service of the lotus feet of Govinda is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 t\'e9rtha-p\'e4da;}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  he does not need to travel on various pilgrimages, for
