hu\'f1\'f6ama,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  the best of the benedictors. He is also known as \'c4\'e7uto\'f1a, which indicates that he is very quickly satisfied and very quickly angered. It is said in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{
