iva, you were created first from the mouth of Lord Brahm\'e4 in order to protect the br\'e4hma\'ebas in pursuing education, austerities, vows and self-realization. As protector of the br\'e4hma\'eb
as, you always protect the regulative principles followed by them, just as a cowherd boy keeps a stick in his hand to give protection to the cows.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid11288628\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
