bhakta-vatsala.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  The Lord is famous as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 bhakta-vatsala,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  which means that He is always favorably inclined to the devotees, whereas He is never address
ed anywhere in the Vedic literature as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9-vatsala.
