a. It is clearly said that everything should be done for the satisfaction of Yaj\'efa, or Vi\'f1\'ebu. All other actions which a person may take are only causes for his bondage. Everyone has to perform }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa}{
