\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  and following the rules and regulations of the four divisions of society and of spiritual life are recommended. It is said in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  that by offering sacrifice to Vi\'f1\'ebu one can gradually be liberated. The whole target of life, therefore, is to please Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. That is }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 Any person who is in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness has dedicated his life for the satisfaction of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the origin of all Vi\'f1\'ebu forms, and by offering worship and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628\charrsid5135716 pras\'e4dam}{
