\cf1\insrsid11288628  the best type of sacrifice is simply to chant Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare. This }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa}{
