{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  Moreover, this }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  performance confirms that Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu is Vi\'f1\'ebu Himself. As Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u appeared at the Dak\'f1a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yaj\'efa}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  long, long ago, Lord Caitanya has appeared in this age to accept our }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 sa\'eck\'e9rtana-yaj\'efa.
