\par }\pard\plain \s289\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf9\insrsid11288628 The Vidy\'e4dharas said:}{\fs28\insrsid11288628 
 Dear Lord, this human form of body is meant for attaining the highest perfectional objective, but, impelled by Your external energy, the living entity misidentifies himself with his body and with the material energy, and therefore, influenced by m\'e4y
\'e4, he wants to become happy b
y material enjoyment. He is misled and always attracted by temporary, illusory happiness. But Your transcendental activities are so powerful that if one engages in the hearing and chanting of such topics, he can be delivered from illusion.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid11288628\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qj \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\insrsid11288628 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11288628 The human form of life is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 arthadam}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  because the body can very nicely help the embodied soul to achieve the highest perfection. Prahl\'e4da Mah\'e4r\'e4ja said that even though it is temporary, the body can give us the highest perfectional achievement. In the 
process of evolution from the lower to the higher grade of living, the human form of life is a great boon. But }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 is so strong that in spite of achieving this great boon of the human form of life, we are influenced by temporary material happiness, and we
 forget our goal of life. We are attracted by things which will cease to exist. The beginning of such attraction is the temporary body. In this horrible condition of life there is only one way of liberation\emdash 
to engage in the activities of transcendental chanting and hearing of the holy name of the Supreme Lord: Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare. The words 
}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 yu\'f1mat-kath\'e4m\'e5ta-ni\'f1evaka\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  mean "those who engage in relishing the nectar of the topics of Your Lo
rdship." There are two narrative books which especially concern the words and activities of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  is the instruction given by K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  is the book containing topics exclusively about K\'e5\'f1\'eba and His devotees. These two books are the special nectar of the words of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. For those who engage in the preaching of these two Vedic literatures it is very easy to get out of the illusory conditional life imposed upon us by }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 The illusion is that the conditioned soul does not try
 to understand his spiritual identity. He is more interested in his external body, which is only a flash and which will be finished as soon as the time is designated. The whole atmosphere will change when the living entity has to transmigrate from one bod
y to another. Under the spell of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  he will again be satisfied in a different atmosphere. This spell of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  is called }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'e4vara\'eb\'e4tmika \'e7akti}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  because it is so strong that the living entity is satisfied in any abominable condition. Even if he is born as a wor
m living within the intestine or abdomen in the midst of urine and stool, still he is satisfied. This is the covering influence of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 But the human form of life is a chance to understand, and if one misses this opportunity, he is most unfortunate. The way to get out of illusory }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  is to engage in the topics of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. Lord Caitanya advocated a process whereby everyone may remain in his present position without change but simply hear from the proper authoritative sources about K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Lord Caitanya advised everyone to spread the word of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a. He advised, "All of you become spiritual masters. Your duty is simply to talk to whomever you meet of K\'e5\'f1\'eba or of the instructions given by K\'e5\'f1\'eba." The International Society for Krishna Consciousness is operating for
 this purpose: we do not ask anyone to first change his position and then come to us; we invite everyone to come with us and simply chant Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4
ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare, because we know that if one simply chants and hears the topics of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, one's life will change; he will see a new light, and his life will be successful.
\par 
