\emdash and; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 \'e7arva\'f9}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash Lord \'c7iva; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 ca}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash and; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 jagata\'f9}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash of the material manifestation; }{
