{\insrsid11288628 \emdash composed of the modes of material nature; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 dvija}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash O twice-born Dak\'f1a; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 s\'e5jan}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash creating; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 rak
\'f1an}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash maintaining; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 haran}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash annihilating; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 vi\'e7vam}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash the cosmic manifestation; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 dadhre}{
\insrsid11288628 \emdash I cause to be born; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 sa\'e0j\'ef\'e4m}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash a name; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 kriy\'e4-ucit\'e4m}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash according to the activity.
