\cf1\insrsid11288628  (7.5), }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 j\'e9va-bh\'fct\'e4\'e0 mah\'e4b\'e4ho:}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  the whole world is energy released from the supreme source, the Personality of Godhead, who, it is further stated in }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  acts in superior energies and inferior energies. The superior energy is the living entity, who is part and parcel of the 
Supreme Lord. As parts and parcels, the living entities are not different from the Supreme Lord; the energy emanated from Him is not different from Him. But in the actual activity of this material world, the living entity is under the different qualities 
o
f material energy and in different forms. There are 8,400,000 life forms. The same living entity acts under the influence of the different qualities of material nature. The entities have different bodies, but originally, in the beginning of creation, Lord
 Vi\'f1\'ebu is alone. For the purpose of creation, Brahm\'e4 is manifested, and for annihilation there is Lord \'c7
iva. As far as the spiritual entrance into the material world is concerned, all beings are part and parcel of the Supreme Lord, but under the covering of different material qualities they have different names. Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7
iva are qualitative incarnations of Vi\'f1\'ebu, as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 gu\'eb\'e4vat\'e4ras,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  and Vi\'f1\'ebu with them accepts control of the quality of goodness; therefore He is also a qualitative incarnation like Lord 
\'c7iva and Lord Brahm\'e4. Actually the different names exist for different directions, otherwise the origin is one only.
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qr \li0\ri0\sb300\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11288628 SB 4.7.52
