 One who is not in proper knowledge thinks that demigods like Brahm\'e4 and \'c7iva are independent, or he even thinks that the living entities are independent.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid11288628\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
