soul, and therefore they are known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 ap\'e4rakya-buddhi.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  Because devotees are learned and know that every living entity is part and parcel of the Supreme Lord, they preach K\'e5\'f1\'eb
