, and he married his sister M\'e5\'f1\'e4. This is the beginning of sex life between brother and sister. This unnatural combination of sex life can be possible in human society only where there is Adharma, Irreligion. It is understood that in the begin
ning of creation Brahm\'e4 created not only saintly sons like Sanaka, San\'e4tana and N\'e4rada but also demonic offspring like Nir\'e5ti, Adharma, Dambha and Falsity. Everything was created by Brahm\'e4 in the beginning. Regarding N\'e4
rada, it is understood that because his previous life was very pious and his association was very good, he was therefore born as N\'e4rada. Others were also born in their own capacities, according to their backgrounds. The law of }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 karma}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  continues birth after birth, and when there is a new creation, the same }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 karma}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
