of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, who is very kind to His devotees; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 mumuk\'f1ubhi\'f9}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash also by persons desiring liberation; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 m\'e5gya}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash 
to be sought after; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 pada-abja}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash lotus feet; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 paddhatim}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash system; }{\cs337\i\insrsid11288628 ananya-bh\'e4ve}{\insrsid11288628 \emdash in  un
