\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid11288628 The system of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 bhakti-yoga}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 described by Queen Sun\'e9ti to her son is the s
tandard way of God realization. Everyone can continue in his constitutional occupational duties and at the same time keep the Supreme Personality of Godhead within his heart. This was also instructed by the Lord Himself to Arjuna in }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4:}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  "Go on fighting, but keep Me within your mind." That should be the motto of every honest person seeking perfection in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. In this connection, Queen Sun\'e9
ti advised her son that the Supreme Personality of Godhead is known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 bh\'e5tya-vatsala,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  which in
dicates that He is very kind to His devotees. She said, "You came to me crying, having been insulted by your stepmother, but I am unable to do any good for you. But K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a is so kind to His devotees that if you go to Him, then the combined kindness of millions of mothers like me would be surpassed by His affectionate and tender dealings. When everyone else fails to mitigate one's misery, K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a is able to help the devotee." Queen Sun\'e9ti also stressed that the process of approaching the Supreme Personality of Godhead is not easy, but is sought after by great sages who are very advanced in spiritual realization. Queen Sun\'e9
ti also indicated by her instruction that Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was only a small child, five years old, and it was not possible for him to purify himself by the way of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2a.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 But by the process of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 bhakti-yoga,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  even a child less than five years old, or anyone of any age, can be purified. That is the special significance of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 bhakti-yoga.}{
\cf1\insrsid11288628  Therefore she advised him not to accept worship of the demigo
ds or any other process, but simply to take to the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and the result would be all perfection. As soon as one places the Supreme Personality of Godhead within one's heart, everything becomes easy and successful.
\par 
\par }\pard\plain \s304\qr \li0\ri0\sb300\sa120\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \v\f35\fs20\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11288628 SB 4.8.23
\par }\pard\plain \s275\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11288628 \b\f35\fs24\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid11288628 TEXT 23
