\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 laghim\'e4-siddhi,}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  or purificatory process to become lighter than the lightest, the inhabitants of Siddhaloka can fly in the sky without airplanes or airships. It is hinted herein by N\'e4
rada Muni to Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja that by meditating upon the transcendental form of the Lord and at the same time chanting the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 mantra}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
