ma and Their energies, and that is the perfect stage of trance. One should not artificially try to see the form of the Lord while chanting Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, but when the chanting is performed offenselessly the Lord will automatically reveal Himself to the view of the chanter. The chanter, therefore, has to concentrate on hearing the vibration, and without extra end
eavor on his part, the Lord will automatically appear.
