\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 k\'f1atriya.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  He was also only five years old, and in his childish way he desired to have a kingdom far greater than his father's, grandfather's or great-grandfather's. His father, Utt\'e4nap\'e4
