i}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 s. Therefore he failed to aim for }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 mukti}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  as his goal in life. But a pure devotee also does not want liberation. He is a soul c
ompletely surrendered to the Supreme Lord, and he does not demand anything from the Lord. This position was realized by Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja when he saw the Supreme Personality of Godhead present personally before him because he was elevated to the }{
