he Supreme Personality of Godhead, and upon His satisfaction the devotee immediately becomes free from all material conditions. The Lord also confirms this in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4:}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
