 try to satisfy themselves by sense gratification, and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  try to satisfy themselves by subtle activities or mental speculation and thinking themselves to be God. }{
