My dear Vidura, when thus asked to accept a benediction from Kuvera the Yak\'f1ar\'e4ja }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid11288628 [King of the Yak\'f1as]}{\fs28\insrsid11288628 , Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4
