 has analyzed all kinds of benedictions available in this world, and he }{\cf1\insrsid3544385 clearly declares}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  that for a pure devotee they are all of no significance. Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja was also a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 
