}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  no contamination of the material world can touch him. He is, therefore, actually purified. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 Muci haya \'e7uci haya yadi k\'e5\'f1\'eba bhaje.}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
 It is said that even a cobbler or person born in the family of a cobbler can be elevated to the position of a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid11288628  (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11288628 \'e7uci}{\cf1\insrsid11288628 
