veNaa(r)JaaTaSYa c PaaE\'e5zai<a Tae\line  vacSPaTaqNaaMaiPa b>a]MauiDaRYa" )) 2 ))
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 n\'e4la\'e0 vaya\'e0 te mahim\'e4nuvar\'ebane
