,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  which means, "one from whom all the incarnations emanate." In }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba says, }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 aha\'e0 sarvasya prabhavo matta\'f9 sarva\'e0 pravartate:}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  "I am the source of all spiritual and material worlds. Everything emanates from Me." }{
