a is the origin of everyone's appearance. As far as this material world is concerned, Lord Brahm\'e4, Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu and Lord \'c7iva are all emanations from K\'e5\'f1\'eba. These three incarnations of K\'e5\'f1\'eba are called }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gu\'eba-avat\'e4ras.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  The material world is governed by three material modes of nature, and Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, Lord Brahm\'e4 and Lord \'c7
