\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and presented by great sages and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
