\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  If one wants to advance in spiritual life, he must take these instructions and follow the principles. In }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhakti-ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  
\'c7r\'e9la R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 says that if one poses himself as advanced in spiritual life but does not refer to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rutis}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sm\'e5tis}{
\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  he is simply a disturbance in society. One should follow the principles laid down in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rutis}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sm\'e5tis
}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  not only in one's spiritual life but in material life as well. As far as human society is concerned, it should follow the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Manu-sm\'e5ti}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 as well, for these laws are given by Manu, the father of mankind.
\par }\pard\plain \s381\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5197105 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 In the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 Manu-sm\'e5ti}{
\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  it is stated that a woman should not be given independence, but should be given protection by her father, husband and elderly sons. In all circumstances a woman should remain dependent upon some guardian.
 Presently women are given full independence like men, but actually we can see that such independent women are no happier than those women who are placed under guardians. If people follow the injunctions given by the great sages, }{
\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e7rutis}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 sm\'e5tis,}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  they ca
n actually be happy in both this life and the next. Unfortunately rascals are manufacturing so many ways and means to be happy. Everyone is inventing so many methods. Consequently human society has lost the standard ways of life, both materially and spiri
t
ually, and as a result people are bewildered, and there is no peace or happiness in the world. Although they are trying to solve the problems of human society in the United Nations, they are still baffled. Because they do not follow the liberated instruct
ions of the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 Vedas,}{\insrsid5197105  they are unhappy.
\par Two significant words used in this verse are }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 asmin}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 amu\'f1min.}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 Asmin}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 means "in this life," and }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 amu\'f1min}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  means "in the next life." Unfortunately in this age, even exalted professors and learned men believe that there is n
o next life and that everything is finished in this life. Since they are rascals and fools, what advice can they give? Still they are passing as learned scholars and professors. In this verse the word }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 amu\'f1min}{
\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is very explicit. It is the duty of everyone to
 mold his life in such a way that he will have a profitable next life. Just as a boy is educated in order to become happy later, one should be educated in this life in order to attain an eternal and prosperous life after death. It is therefore essential t
hat people follow what is given in the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e7rutis}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 sm\'e5tis}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  to make sure that the human mission is successful.}{\insrsid5197105 

