\emdash without another self; }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e4tma-\'e4tmana\'f9}{\cs372\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 \emdash to the body and mind; }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 para\'f9}{\cs372\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 \emdash transcendental.
