ure, nonmaterial and self-effulgent. He is the reservoir of all good qualities, and He is all-pervading. He is wit
hout material covering, and He is the witness of all activities. He is completely distinguished from other living entities, and He is transcendental to all embodied souls.
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1064765 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid1064765\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
