u Pur\'e4\'eba.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Occupational duties are known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 var\'eb\'e4\'e7rama-dharma}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 and apply to the four divisions of material and spiritual life\emdash namely }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra,}{
