Personality of Godhead. Devotional service is very simple, and anyone can adopt it. Let one remain what he is; he need only install the Deity of the Supreme Lord in his house. The Deity may be R\'e4dh\'e4-K\'e5\'f1\'eba or Lak\'f1m\'e9-N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a (there are many other forms of the Lord). In this way a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra}{
