ers of society have a poor fund of knowledge and the citizens in general are rogues and thieves, there cannot be an auspicious situation for human society. At the present moment the whole world is full of such an incompatible combination of state and citi
zens, and therefore there is constant tension, war and anxiety as an inevitable result of such social conditions.
