l love you, and very soon you will be able to see such already liberated personalities as the four Kum\'e4ras }{\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 [Sanaka, San\'e4tana, Sanandana and Sanat-kum\'e4ra]}{\cs375\fs28\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 .
