 practice cannot satisfy Him. He is }{\cs380\cf1\insrsid15953474\charrsid5197105 only}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid15953474  }{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 pleased by elevated character and behavior. But these cannot develop unless one 
