, (10) benevolent, (11) peaceful, (12) completely attached to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, (13) has no material hankering, (14) meek, (15) steady, (16) self-controlled, (17) does not eat more than required, (18) sane, (19) respectful, (20) humble, (21) grave, (22) compassionate,
 (23) friendly, (24) poetic, (25) expert, (26) silent. The Lord is satisfied by development of the transcendental qualities of the living entity and not by artificial performance of sacrifices and mystic }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga.}{
\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  In other words, unless one is fully qualified to be}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid15953474 come a pure devotee of the Lord}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 one cannot expect to be liberated from material entanglement.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105 
