 refers to those who are advancing spiritually. In the history of the human race, the \'c4ryan family is considered to be the most elevated community in the world because it adopts the Vedic civilization. The \'c4
ryan family is distributed all over the world and is known as Indo-\'c4ryan. In prehistoric days all of the members of the \'c4ryan family followed the Vedic principles, and therefore they became spiritually advanced. The kings, known as }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 r\'e4jar\'f1is,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  were so perfectly educated as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1atriyas,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
