ryan family very quickly catch the essence of spiritual life. How is it that we are finding it very easy to spread K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness among the Europeans and Americans? History reports th
at the Americans and Europeans proved their capability when they were anxious to expand colonization, but at the present time, being contaminated by the advancement of material science, their sons and grandsons are turning into reprobates. This is due to 
their having lost their original spiritual culture, which is Vedic civilization. Presently these descendants of the \'c4ryan family are taking this K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement very seriously. Others }{\cs383\insrsid7299173\charrsid5197105 also}{
\cs383\insrsid7299173  }{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 who are associating with them and hearing}{\cs383\insrsid7299173  the chanting of the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 mah\'e4-mantra}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 from the lips of pure devotees are }{\cs383\insrsid7299173 also}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  becoming captivated by the transcendental vibration. Transcendental vibrations are very much effective when chanted among \'c4
ryans, but even though one does not belong to the \'c4ryan family, he will become a Vai\'f1\'ebava simply by hearing the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 mantra}{\insrsid5197105  because the vibration has great influence over everyone.
\par Mah\'e4r\'e4ja P\'e5thu points out that even the goddess of fortune, who is the constant companion of Lord N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, specifically wanted to hear about the Lord's glories, and for the association of the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s,}{
\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  who are pure devotees, the goddess of fortune, Lak\'f1m\'e9, underwent severe austerities. The impersonalist may ask why one should bother chanting the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 mah\'e4-mantra}{
\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  continually for so many years instead of stopping and trying for }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 kaivalya,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  liberation, or merging into the existence of the Lord. In answer, Mah\'e4r\'e4ja P\'e5
thu maintains that the attraction of this chanting is so great that one cannot give up the process unless he is an animal. This is the case even if one comes in contact with this transcendental vibration by chance. P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja is very emphatic in this connection\emdash only an animal can give up the practice of chanting Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Those who are not animals}{\insrsid7299173 ,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  }{\insrsid7299173 who are}{
\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  actually intelligent, advanced, human, civilized men}{\insrsid7299173 ,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  cannot give up this practice of continually chanting Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5
\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare.}{\insrsid5197105 
