\par }\pard\plain \s373\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5197105 \b\f35\fs28\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 My dear Lord of the u}{\insrsid2510553 
niverse, the goddess of fortune Lak\'f1m\'e9}{\insrsid5197105  is the mother of the universe, and yet I think that she may be angry with me because of my in
truding upon her service and acting on that very platform to which she is so much attached. Yet I am hopeful that}{\insrsid2510553 ,}{\insrsid5197105  even though there is some misunderstanding, You will take my part}{\insrsid2510553  because}{
\insrsid5197105  You are very much inclined to the poor}{\insrsid2510553 ,}{\insrsid5197105  and You always magnify even
 insignificant service unto You. Therefore even though she becomes angry, I think that there is no harm for You, because You are so self-sufficient that You can do without her.
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1064765 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid1064765\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
