thu worshiped the demigods, the great sages, the inhabitants of Pit\'e5loka, the inhabitants of Gandharvaloka and those of Siddhaloka, C\'e4ra\'eb
aloka, Pannagaloka, Kinnaraloka, Apsaroloka, the earthly planets and the planets of the birds. He also worshiped many other living entities who presented themselves in the sacrificial arena. 
With folded hands he worshiped all these, as well as the Supreme Personality of Godhead and the personal associates of the Lord, by offering sweet words and as much wealth as possible. After this function, they all went back to their respective abodes, fo
llowing in the footsteps of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu.
\par }\pard\plain \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1064765 \b\f35\fs24\cf13\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid1064765\charrsid8793718 PURPORT}{
\fs28\cf11\insrsid1064765\charrsid3754542 
\par }\pard\plain \s280\qc \li0\ri0\sb360\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \b\f35\fs28\cf11\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\v\insrsid5197105 PURPORT
\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
In modern so-called scientific society the idea is very prevalent that there is no life on other planets but that only on this earth do living entities with intelligence and scientific knowledge exist.
 The Vedic literatures, however, do not accept this foolish theory. The followers of Vedic wisdom are fully aware of various planets inhabited by varieties of living entities such as the demigods, the sages, the Pit\'e4
s, the Gandharvas, the Pannagas, the Kinnaras, the C\'e4ra\'ebas, the Siddhas and the Apsar\'e4s. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  give information that in all planets\emdash 
not only within this material sky but also in the spiritual sky\emdash there are varieties of living entities. Although all these living entities are of one spiritual 
nature, in quality the same as the Supreme Personality of Godhead, they have varieties of bodies due to the embodiment of the spirit soul by the eight material elements, namely earth, water, fire, air, sky, mind, intelligence and false ego. In the spiritu
a
l world, however, there is no such distinction between the body and the embodied. In the material world, distinctive features are manifested in different types of bodies in the various planets. We have full information from the Vedic literature that in ea
ch and every planet, both material and spiritual, there are living entities of varied intelligence. The earth is one of the planets of the Bh\'fcrloka planetary system. There are six planetary systems above Bh\'fc
rloka and seven planetary systems below it. Therefore the entire universe is known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 caturda\'e7a-bhuvana,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 indicating that it has fourteen different planetary systems. Beyond the planetary systems in the material sky, there is another sky, which is known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 paravyoma,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 or the spiritual sky, where there are spiritual planets. The inhabitants of those planets engage in varieties of loving service unto the Supreme Personality of Godhead, which include different }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid8793718 rasas}{
\cs380\cf1\insrsid8793718  or relationships}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 d\'e4sya-rasa, sakhya-rasa, v\'e4tsalya-rasa, m\'e4dhurya-rasa}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and, above all, }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 parak\'e9ya-rasa.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  This }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 parak\'e9ya-rasa,}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or paramour love, is prevalent in K\'e5\'f1\'ebaloka, where Lord K
\'e5\'f1\'eba lives. This planet is also called Goloka V\'e5nd\'e4vana, and although Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba lives there perpetually, He also expands Himself in millions and trillions of forms
. In one of such forms He appears on this material planet in a particular place known as V\'e5nd\'e4vana-dh\'e4ma, where He displays His original pastimes of Goloka V\'e5nd\'e4vana-dh\'e4
ma in the spiritual sky in order to attract the conditioned souls back home, back to Godhead.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105 
