aterial world is conditioned by the modes of material nature and therefore has four defects. But although P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja was above all these, still, like an ordinary conditioned soul, he presented his statements to the great souls, sages and saintly persons present there.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105 
