\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 "A person who is fully absorbed in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness is sure to attain the spiritual kingdom because of his full contr}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid4198056 ibution to spiritual activities}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 in which the consummation is absolute and that which is offered is of the same spiritual nature." }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid4198056 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid4198056 4.24}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid4198056\charrsid5197105 )}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid4198056  }{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 The performer of sacrifices must always keep in view that the sacrifices mentioned in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 are meant to satisfy the Supreme Personality of Godhead. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vi\'f1\'ebur \'e4r\'e4dhyate panth\'e4\'f9}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 (}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vi\'f1\'ebu Pur\'e4\'eba}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  3.8.9)}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 . Anything material or spiritual done for the satisfaction of the Supreme Lord is understood to be an actual }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yaj\'efa,}{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and by performing such }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yaj\'efas}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  one gets liberation from material bondage. The direct meth
od of getting liberation from material bondage is devotional service, comprising the nine following methods:
