\cf1\insrsid4198056 h}{\fs28\cf1\insrsid4198056 \'e4}{\cf1\insrsid4198056 g.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\i0\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid4198056 7.5.23}{\i0\cf1\insrsid4198056\charrsid4198056 )}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 This ninefold process is described in this verse as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vi
\'e7uddha-vij\'ef\'e4na-ghana\'f9,}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or satisfying the Supreme Personality of Godhead directly by transcendental knowledge concentrated on the form of the Supreme Lord, Vi\'f1\'eb
u. This is the best method for satisfying the Supreme Lord. One who cannot take to this direct process, however, should take the indirect process of performing }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yaj\'efas}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  f}{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid4198056 or the satisfaction of Vi\'f1\'ebu}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or Yaj\'efa. Vi\'f1\'ebu is therefore called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yaj\'efa-pati.}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  }{
