\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 The Supreme Personality of Godhead's de
ep scientific knowledge is concentrated to the supreme point. For example, medical science knows some things superficially, but }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid13240932 the }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
doctors do not know exactly how things happen in the body. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, however, knows everything in detail. Therefore His knowledge is }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vij\'ef\'e4na-ghana}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 because it does not have any of the defects of material science. The Supreme Personality of Godhead is }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vi\'e7uddha-vij\'ef\'e4na-ghana,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 concentrated transcendental knowledge; therefore, even though He accepts }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karma-k\'e4\'eb\'f2\'e9ya}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  materialistic }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yaj\'efas,}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  He always remains in a transcendental position. Therefore, the mention of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 aneka-gu\'eba}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 refers to the Supreme Personality of Godhead's many transcendental qualities, for He is not affected by the material qualities. The different kinds of material paraph
ernalia or physical elements are also gradually transformed into spiritual understanding because ultimately there is no difference between material and spiritual qualities, for everything emanates from the Supreme Spirit. This is realized by a gradual pro
cess of realization and purification. One vivid example of this is Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4
ja, who took to meditation in the forest to achieve material benefit but ultimately became spiritually advanced and did not want any benediction for material profit. He was simply satisfied with the association of the Supreme Lord. }{
