\'e4m}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 ), one can be transferred from ignorance and passion to goodness by the results of his activities (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 kriy\'e4-phalatvena}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
