 universally purifying. The more we discuss His opulences, the more the universe becomes purer and 
purer. In the material world, the opulences possessed by a material person are never fixed. Today one may be a very rich man, but tomorrow he may become poor; today one is very famous, but tomorrow he may be infamous. Materially obtained opulences are nev
er fixed, but all six opulences perpetually exist in the Supreme Personality of Godhead, not only in the spiritual world but also in this material world. Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba's reputation is fixed, and His book of wisdom, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is still honored. Everything pertaining to the Supreme Personality of Godhead is eternally existing.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105 
