 offer them drinking water, for drinking water is available always. In India the custom is that even an ordinary person is offered a glass of water if he suddenly visits and one cannot offer him foodstuff. If there is no water, then one can offer a sittin
g place, even i}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5207868 f it is on straw mats. And if h}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
