\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or those in the renounced order of life, take trouble to enlighten the householders. There are }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ekada\'eb\'f2\'e9 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 trida\'eb\'f2\'e9 sanny\'e4s\'e9s.}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ekada\'eb\'f2\'e9 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  are generally followers of \'c7a\'ec
