avas know that the Absolute Truth is the Supreme Person and that the Brahman effulgence is based on the Supreme Personality of Godhead, as confirmed in the }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs380\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 : }{
