 are both called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1etra-vit.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  But there is a difference between the two kinds of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1etra-vit.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  One }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1etra-vit,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or knower of the body, namely the Param\'e4tm\'e4
