 but should cultivate spiritual knowledge to understand the Supersoul and the individual soul and their relationship. In th
is way, by advancement of knowledge, one can achieve liberation and the ultimate goal of life. It is said that if one takes to the path of liberation, even rejecting his so-called duties in the material world, he is not a loser at all. But a person who do
