Since only a person who is completely educated according to the principles of Vedic knowledge deserves to be commander-in-chief, ruler of the state, the first to chastise and the proprietor of the whole planet, P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4ja of
fered everything to the Kum\'e4ras.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7615227 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid7615227\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
