\par }\pard\plain \s384\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5197105 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 "This material nature is working under My direction, O son of Kunt\'e9
, producing all the moving and unmoving beings, and by its rule this manifestation is created and annihilated again and again."}{\insrsid6555778  }{\cs383\insrsid6555778 (Bg. }{\insrsid6555778 9.10}{\cs383\insrsid6555778\charrsid5197105 )}{
\insrsid5197105 
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 All material changes and material progress taking place
 by the wonderful interaction of matter are under the superintendence of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Events in the material world are not taking place blindly. If one always remains a servant of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a and engages everything in His service, one is accepted as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 j\'e9van-mukta,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 a liberated soul, even during his lifetime within the material world. Generally liberation takes place after one gives up this body, but one who lives according to the example of P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4ja is liberated even in this lifetime. In K\'e5\'f1
\'eba consciousness the results of one's activities depend on the will of the Supreme Person. Indeed, in all cases the result is not dependent on one's own personal dexterity but is completely dependent on the will of the Supreme. This is the real 
significance of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 phala\'e0 brahma\'ebi sannyasya.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 A soul dedicated to the service of the Lord should never think of himself as the personal proprietor or the superintendent. A dedicated devotee should prosecute his work according to the rules and regulations desc
ribed in devotional service. The results of his activities are completely dependent on the supreme will of the Lord.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105 
\par }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid14643438\charrsid5197105 
