a, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, one should chant the holy name of the Lord continuously, twenty-four hours a day. Unfortunate persons who cannot accept this formula prefer to execute some type of pseudo}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5862124 -}{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 meditation without accepting the other processes of austerity. The fact is, however, that one must accept either the severe method of aust
erity described above to become purified or take to the process of devotional service recommended for pleasing the Supreme Lord, K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The person who is K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a conscious is most intelligent because in Kali-yuga it is not at all possible to undergo such severe austerities. We need only follow great personalities like Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu. In His }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7ik\'f1\'e4\'f1\'f6aka,}{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu wrote, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 para\'e0 vijayate \'e7r\'e9-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-sa\'eck\'e9rtanam:}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  all glories to the holy names of Lord K
\'e5\'f1\'eba, which from the very beginning purify the heart and immediately liberate one. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5862124 Bhava-mah\'e4}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 d\'e4v\'e4gni-nirv\'e4panam.}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 If the real purpose of all }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is to please Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba, then this simple }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 bhakti-yoga}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 system recommended for this age is sufficient. It is necessary, however, to engage constantly in the service of the Lord. Although P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4ja executed his austerities long before the appearance of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a on this planet, his purpose was still to please K\'e5\'f1\'eba.
\par }\pard\plain \s381\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid5197105 \f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 There are many fools who claim that worship of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a began only about five thousand years ago, after the appearance of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba in India, but this is not a fact. P\'e5thu Mah\'e4r\'e4ja worshiped K\'e5\'f1\'eba millions of years ago, for P\'e5thu happened to be a descendant of the family of Mah
\'e4r\'e4ja Dhruva, who reigned for }{\cs383\insrsid5862124 36,000}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  years during the Satya-yuga age. Unless his total life-span was }{\cs383\insrsid5862124 100,000}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 years, how could Dhruva Mah\'e4r\'e4ja reign over the world for }{\cs383\insrsid5862124 36,000}{\cs383\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  years? The point is that K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a worship existed at the beginning of creation and has continued to exist throughout Satya-yuga, Tret\'e4-yuga and Dv\'e4para-yuga, and now it is continuing in Kali-yuga. As stated in }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-g\'e9t\'e4,}{\insrsid5197105  K\'e5
\'f1\'eba }{\insrsid5862124 not only }{\insrsid5197105 appears in this millennium of Brahm\'e4's life, but in every millennium. Therefore worship of K\'e5\'f1\'eba is conducted in all millenniums. It is not that K\'e5\'f1\'eba worship began only when K
\'e5\'f1\'eba appeared on this planet five thousand years ago. This is a foolish conclusion that is not substantiated by Vedic literatures.
\par Also of significance in this verse are the words }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e4rir\'e4dhayi\'f1u\'f9 k\'e5\'f1\'ebam acarat tapa uttamam.}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Mah\'e4r\'e4ja P\'e5thu underwent 
severe types of austerities for the express purpose of worshiping K\'e5\'f1\'eba. K\'e5\'f1\'eba is so kind, especially in this age, that He appears in the transcendental vibration of His holy name. As is said in the }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 N\'e4rada-pa
\'efcar\'e4tra, \'e4r\'e4dhito yadi haris tapas\'e4 tata\'f9 kim.}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  If K\'e5\'f1\'eba is worshiped, if He is the goal of advancement, there is no need for one to execute severe types of }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 tapasya,}{
\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  because one has already reached his destination. If, after executing all types of }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 tapasya,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  one cannot reach K\'e5\'f1\'eba, all his }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 
tapasya}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  has no value, for without K\'e5\'f1\'eba all austerity is simply wasted labor. }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'c7rama eva hi kevalam}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  }{\i\insrsid16085486\charrsid16085486 (Bh\'e4g.}{
\insrsid5197105  1.2.8)}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 . We should therefore not be discouraged just because we cannot go to the forest and practice severe austerities. Our life is so short that we must strictly ad
here to the principles laid down by the Vai\'f1\'ebava }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and peacefully execute K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness. There is no need to become despondent. Narottama d\'e4sa \'d6h\'e4
kura recommends: }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 \'e4nande bala hari, bhaja v\'e5nd\'e4vana, \'e7ri-guru-vai\'f1\'ebava-pade maj\'e4iy\'e4 mana.}{\insrsid5862124  For a transcendental}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  blissful life, chant the Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 mantra,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  come worship the holy place of V\'e5nd\'e4vana, and always engage in the service of the Lord, of the spiritual master}{\insrsid14501862 ,}{\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 and of the Vai\'f1\'ebavas. This K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement is therefore very safe and easy. We have only to execute the order of the Lord and fully surrender unto Him. We have only to execute the order of the spiritual master, preach K\'e5
\'f1\'eba consciousness and follow in the path of the Vai\'f1\'ebavas. The spiritual master represents both Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba and the Vai\'f1\'ebavas; therefore by following the instructions of the spiritual master and by chanting Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, everything will be all right.}{\insrsid5197105 
