\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 Only by worshiping V\'e4
sudeva can one become free from the desires of fruitive activities. Outside of worshiping V\'e4sudeva, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yog\'e9s}{\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{
\cs386\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  cannot attain freedom from }{\cs386\cf1\insrsid4402189 such desires. }{\cs386\i\cf1\insrsid4402189\charrsid4402189 T}{\i\insrsid5197105\charrsid4402189 advan na }{\i\insrsid4402189\charrsid4402189 
