thu's activities in devotional service enabled him to become fixed and steady in the discharge of devotional activities without having to take recourse to }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karma, j\'ef\'e4na}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or }{
