ja became transcendental in mind and could therefore constantly think of the lotus feet of the Lord. Because of this, he became completely detached and attained perfect
 knowledge by which he could transcend all doubt. Thus he was freed from the clutches of false ego and the material conception of life.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7615227 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid7615227\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
