\cf1\insrsid5197105  In the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  process, after following the strict regulative principles controlling sleeping, eating and mating, one is allowed to practice the different s
itting postures. The ultimate aim of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  is to enable one to give up this body according to his own free will. One who has attained the ultimate summit of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  practice can live in the body as long as he likes or, as long as he is not completely perfect, leave the body to go anywhere within or outside the universe. Some }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yog\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 leave their bodies to go to the higher planetary systems and enjoy the material facilities therein. However, intelligent }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yog\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  do not wish to waste their time within this material wor
ld at all; they do not care for the material facilit}{\cf1\insrsid11743663 ies in higher planetary systems}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  but are interested in going directly to the spiritual sky, back home, back to Godhead.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid11743663 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 From the description in this verse, it appears that Mah\'e4r
\'e4ja P\'e5thu had no desire to promote himself to the higher planetary systems. He wanted to return home immediately, back to Godhead. Although Mah\'e4r\'e4ja P\'e5thu stopped all practice of mystic }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  after realizing K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, he }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid11743663 nonetheless }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 took advantage of his previous practice and immediately placed himself on the 
}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  platform in order to accelerate his return to Godhead. The aim of this particular system of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4sana,}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  known as the sitting posture for liberation, or }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mukt\'e4sana,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is to attain success in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ku\'eb\'f2alin\'e9
-cakra}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and gradually raise the life from the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'fcl\'e4dh\'e4ra-cakra}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sv\'e4dhi\'f1\'f6h\'e4
na-cakra,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  then to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ma\'ebip\'fcra-cakra,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 an\'e4hata-cakra,}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vi\'e7uddha-cakra,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  and finally to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4j\'ef\'e4-cakra.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 When the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yog\'e9}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  reaches the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4j\'ef\'e4-cakra,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  between the two eyebrows, he is able to penetrate the }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-randhra,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or the hole in his skull, }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid11743663 and go to any planet he desires}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  up to the spiritual kingdom of Vaiku
\'eb\'f6ha, or K\'e5\'f1\'ebaloka. The conclusion is that one has to come to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  stage for going back to Godhead. However, those who are in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, or who are practicing }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 bhakti-yoga}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtan}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11743663 a\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9 smara\'eba\'e0 p
\'e4da-sevanam}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 ), can return to Godhead without even practicing the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mukt\'e4sana}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  process. The purpose of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
mukt\'e4sana}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  practice is to come to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  stage, for without being on the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta}{
