ered the total designation of the living entity unto the supreme controller of illusory energy. Being released from all the designations by which the living entity became entrapped, he became free by knowledge and renunciation and by the spiritual force o
f his devotional service. In this way, being situated in his original constitutional position of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, he gave up this body as a prabhu, or controller of the senses.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7615227 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid7615227\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
