When one wants to cross a large ocean, he requires a strong boat. It is said that this human form of life is a good boat by which one can cross the ocean of nescience. In the human form of life one can obtain the guidance of a good nav}{\insrsid532114 
igator, the spiritual master. H}{\insrsid5197105 e also gets a favorable wind by the mercy of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and that wind is the instructions of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The human body is the boat, the instructions of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a are the favorable winds, and the spiritual master is the navigator. The spiritual master knows well how to adjust the sails to catch the winds favorably and steer the boat to its destination. If, however, one does not take a}{\insrsid532114 
dvantage of this opportunity, h}{\insrsid5197105 e wastes the human form of life. Wasting time and life in this way is the same as committing suicide.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 The word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 labdhv\'e4pavargyam}{
