 which means attaining the very planet where the Supreme Personality of Godhead resides. There are five kinds of liberation, and one is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 s\'e4yujya-mukti,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or merging in}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid532114 to the existence of the Supreme}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  or the impersonal Brahman effulgence. However, since there is a chance of one's falling down again into the material sky from the Brahman effulgence, \'c7
r\'e9la J\'e9va Gosv\'e4m\'e9 advises that in this human form of life one's only aim should be to go back home, back to Godhead. The words }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sa va\'efcita\'f9}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 indicate that once a person has obtained the human form of life, he is actually cheated if he does not make preparations to go back home, back to Godhead. The position of all nond}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid532114 evotees}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  who are not inte}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid532114 rested in going back to Godhead}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is very much la
mentable, for the human form of life is meant for executing devotional service and nothing else.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105 
