ava is the spiritual master, and he is nondifferent from the Supreme Personality of Godhead. It is said that sometimes Lord Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu used to chant the names of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s.}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Some of the Lord's students tried to advise Him to chant the name of K\'e5\'f1\'eba instead, but upon hearing this Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu became very angry with His students. The controvers
y on this subject reached a point that after this incident Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu decided to take }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sanny\'e4sa}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  because He was not taken very seriously in His }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 g\'e5hastha-\'e4\'e7rama.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  The point is that since \'c7r\'e9 Caitanya Mah\'e4prabhu chanted the names of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s,}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  worship of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 
 or the devotees of the Lord is as good as devotional service rendered directly to the Lord. It is also stated by the Lord Himself that devotional service to His devotees is better than service offered directly to Him. Sometimes the }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sahajiy\'e4}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  class of devotees are }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid15543319\charrsid5197105 only}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid15543319  interested}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  in K\'e5\'f1
\'eba's personal pastimes to the exclusion of the activities of the devotees. This type of devotee is not on a very high level; one who sees the devotee and the Lord on the same level has further progressed.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105 
\par }{\cs383\cf1\insrsid14643438\charrsid5197105 
