 it is recommended that one should become a devotee regardless of one's condition. Whether one is without desire (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ak\'e4ma}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ) or with desire (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sak\'e4ma}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
), or whether one desires liberation (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mok\'f1a-k\'e4ma}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ), he is advised to worship the Supreme Lord and execute devotional service unto Him. By so doing, one attains all perfection in 
any field of life. The process of devotional service\emdash especially hearing and chanting\emdash is so powerful that it can bring a person to the perfectional stage. In this verse }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'ebas, k\'f1atriyas, vai\'e7yas}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdras}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  are mentioned, but here it should be understood that that reference is to the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 who is born in a brahminical family, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1atriya}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  who is born in a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'f1atriya}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  family, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vai\'e7ya}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  who is born in a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vai\'e7ya}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  family and the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  in a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 family. But whether one is a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba, k\'f1atriya, vai\'e7ya}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  he can attain perfection simply by hearing and chanting.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105 To take birth in a family of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'ebas}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is not the ultimate finishing touch; one must have the power of a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  which is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
brahma-tejas.}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  Similarly, taking birth in a royal family is not the all in all; one must possess the power to rule the world. Similarly, taking birth as a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vai\'e7ya}{
\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  is not all; one must possess hundreds or thousands of animals (specifically cows) and rule over other }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vai\'e7yas}{\cs383\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid5197105  as Nanda Mah\'e4r\'e4
