tus flower, in the evening. Combined together, the lotus flowers filled the lake so full that the lake appeared to be a great min}{\fs28\insrsid11475879 e of such flowers. Consequently}{\fs28\insrsid5197105 
 on the shores there were swans and cranes, cakrav\'e4ka, k\'e4ra\'eb\'f2ava and other beautiful water birds}{\fs28\insrsid11475879 ,}{\fs28\insrsid5197105  standing about.
