sudeva. You are most peaceful, and because of Your self-illuminated existence, You are not disturbed by the six kinds of transformations.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid7615227 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid7615227\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
