iva is trying to purify false egotism through the mercy of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Since Lord \'c7iva, or Rudra, is himself the controller of egotism, he indirectly wants to be purified by the mercy of the Lord so that his real ego}{
\cf1\insrsid3231031 tism can be awakened. Of course}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Lord Rudra is always spiritually awake, but for our benefit he is praying in this way. For the impersonalist, pure egotism is }{\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 a}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
ha\'e0 brahm\'e4smi}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 \emdash "I am not this body; I am spirit soul." But in its actual position, the spirit soul has devotional activities to perform. Therefore Lord \'c7
iva prays to be engaged both in mind and in action in the devotional service of the Supreme Lord according to the direction of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  This is the process for purifying false egotism. }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Ceta\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid2760420  means knowledge.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Without perfect knowledge, one cannot act perfectly. The real source of knowledge is the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 v\'e4ca\'f9,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 or sound vibration, given by Vedic instructions. Here the word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 v\'e4ca\'f9,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 or vibration, means the Vedic vibration. The origin of creation is sound vibration, and if the sound vibration is clear and purified, perfect knowledge and perfect activities actually become manifest. This is enacted by the chanting of the }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mah\'e4-mantra}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare K\'e5\'f1\'eba, K\'e5\'f1\'eba K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Hare Hare/ Hare R\'e4ma, Hare R\'e4ma, R\'e4ma R\'e4ma, Hare Hare. Thus Lord \'c7
iva is praying again and again for the purification of body, mind and activities through the purification of knowledge and action under the pure directions of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Lord \'c7
iva prays to the Supreme Personality of Godhead so that his mind, senses and words will all turn toward devotional activities only.
