mbuda-sundar\'e4\'ecgam.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The Lord wears a peacock feather in His hair, and His bodily complexion is just like a blackish cloud. The word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sundara,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
snigdha,}{\cf1\insrsid16207979  means very pleasing, even}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cf1\insrsid16207979 when compared with }{\i\cf1\insrsid16207979\charrsid16207979 k}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 andarpa-ko\'f6i-kaman\'e9ya.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  K\'e5\'f1
\'eba's beauty is so pleasing that not even millions upon millions of Cupids can compare to it. The Lord's form as Vi\'f1\'ebu is decorated in all opulence; therefore Lord \'c7iva is trying to see that most opulent form of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, or Vi\'f1\'eb
u. Generally the worship of the Lord begi}{\cf1\insrsid3491094 ns with the worship of N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or Vi\'f1\'ebu, whereas the worship of Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba and R\'e4dh\'e4 is most confidential. Lord N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eb
a is worshipable by the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid3491094 P}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4\'efcar\'e4trika-vidhi,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or regulative principles, whereas Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba is worshipable by the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid3491094 B}{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 h\'e4gavata-vidhi.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  No one can worship the Lord in the }{\i\cf1\insrsid3491094\charrsid3491094 B}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 h\'e4gavata-vidhi}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 without going through the regulations of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid3491094 P}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4\'efcar\'e4trika-vidhi.}{\cf1\insrsid6899405  Actually}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  neophyte devotees worship the Lord according to the }{
