. Without being fearless, one cannot be joyful. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 bhaktas,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the devote
es, are fearless and always joyful because they are constantly engaged in the service of the lotus feet of the Lord. It is also said:
