 one can understand the Supreme Lord in truth, but without such understanding, one cannot enter the spiritual kingdom. One may be elevated to the heavenly planets or may realize himself as Brahman (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 aha\'e0 brahm\'e4smi}{
