My dear Lord, You are the only Supreme Person, the cause of all causes. Before the creation of this material world, Your material energy remains in a dormant condition. When Your material energy is agitated, the three qualities\emdash namely}{
\fs28\insrsid3685903 ,}{\fs28\insrsid5197105  goodness, passion and ignorance\emdash act, and as a result the total material energy\emdash egotism, ether, air, fire, water, earth and all the various demigods and saintly persons\emdash 
