ifestation in four different types of bodies. The word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 catur-vidham}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 is significant in this verse. There are four types of living entities born within this material world. Some are born by way of an embryo (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 jar\'e4yu ja}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ), by way of eggs (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 a
