 else are trying to make things permanent. One foolish scientist recently declared that eventually life will be made permanent through science. Some so-called scientists are also trying to manufacture living entities within the laboratory. Thus in one way
 or another everyone is busy denying the existence of the Supreme Personality of Godhead and rejecting the supreme authority of the Lord. However, the Lord is so powerful that He destroys everything in the form of death. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{
\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 , }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e5tyu\'f9 sarva-hara\'e7 c\'e4ham:}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  "I am all-devouring death." }{
\cs347\cf1\insrsid6570692\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid6570692 10.34) }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 The Lord is just like death to the atheists, for He takes away everything they accumulate in the material world. Hira\'ebyaka\'e7ipu, the father of Prahl
\'e4da, always denied the existence of the Lord, and he tried to kill his five-year-old boy due to the boy's unflinching faith in God. However, in due course of time the Lord appeared as N\'e5si\'e0hadeva and killed Hira\'ebyaka\'e7
ipu in the presence of his son. As stated in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 , this killing process is natural. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 J\'e9vo j\'e9vasya j\'e9vanam:}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  "}{
