\'f1\'eba will bestow His mercy upon him (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4\'e7\'e4-bandha\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ), and he should always be very eager to serve the Lord faithfully (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 samutka\'eb\'f6h\'e4}{
