rada Muni how he could get out of this }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karma-bandha-ph\'e4\'ecsa,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  entanglement in fruitive activities. This is actually the stage of knowledge indicated in the first verse of }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra:}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ath\'e4to brahma jij\'ef\'e4s\'e4}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid471603  }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid471603\charrsid471603 (Vs. 1.1.1)}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 .}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  When one actually reaches the platform of frustration in an attempt to discharge }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karma-bandha-ph\'e4\'ecsa,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  he inquires about the real value of life, which is called }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma jij\'ef\'e4s\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  In order to inquire about the ultimate goal of life, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  enjoin, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 tad-vij\'ef\'e4n\'e4rtha
\'e0 sa gurum ev\'e4bhigacchet}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid471603  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid471603\charrsid471603 (}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid471603\charrsid471603 Mu\'eb\'f2aka Up.}{\cf1\insrsid471603  1.2.12)}{\cf1\insrsid12933571 .}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 "In order to understand the transcendental science, one must approach a bona fide spiritual master."
