\cf1\insrsid12933571\charrsid12933571 1.}{\cf1\insrsid12933571 2.10)}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 .}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  As stated in the Second Chapter of the First Canto of }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
