NaSYa cirTa& iNabaeDa GadTaae MaMa )) 9 ))
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 atra te kathayi\'f1ye 'mum
\par itih\'e4sa\'e0 pur\'e4tanam
\par pura\'efjanasya carita\'e0
