\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 , }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid1211482 na j\'e4yate mriyate v\'e4 }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid1211482\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid1211482 2.20)}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid1211482 .}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  "The living entity is never born and never dies." Because he is eternal, his activities are eternal, although they are performed in different types of bodies. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid1211482 Na hanyate hanyam\'e4ne \'e7ar\'e9re}{
