a by virtue of his past pious activities gets full facility to develop the human form of life. In India, the climatic condition is such that one can live very peacefully without being disturbed by material conditions. Indeed, during the time of Mah\'e4r
\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6hira or Lord R\'e4macandra, people were free from all anxieties. There was not even extreme cold or extreme heat. The three kinds of miserable conditions}{\insrsid3955966 \emdash }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 adhy\'e4
