were all absent during the reign of Lord R\'e4macandra or Mah\'e4r\'e4ja Yudhi\'f1\'f6hir
a. But at present, compared to other countries on earth, India is artificially disturbed. Despite these material disturbances, however, the country's culture is such that one can easily attain the goal of life\emdash 
namely salvation, or liberation from material bondage. Thus in order to take birth in India one must }{\cf1\insrsid9911900  perform}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  many pious activities in a past life.
