jana, to seduce the girl, introduced himself as such a personality. In the material world, whether one be a m
an or a woman, one wants to enjoy. A man wants to enjoy a beautiful woman, and a woman wants to enjoy a powerful, opulent man. Every living entity who possesses such material desires is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 puru\'f1a,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
