ause of this, people living in the West are more addicted to sense gratification. In this }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  it is confirmed: }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4sur\'e9 n\'e4ma pa\'e7c\'e4d dv\'e4\'f9.}{
