 is very significant in this verse. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vi}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  means "specifically," and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 pralabdha}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 means "obtained." Just to satisfy his desires, the King got the Queen, and thus he became cheated by material existence. Although he was not willing to do so, he remained }{\cf1\insrsid6291856 as }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
a pet animal under the control of material intelligence. Just as a pet monkey dances according to the desires of its master, the King danced according to the desires of the Queen. In }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cf1\insrsid6291856 it is said:}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mahat-sev\'e4\'e0 dv\'e4ram \'e4hur vimukte\'f9}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid6291856  }{\cf1\insrsid6291856 (}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid6291856 Bh\'e4g. }{
\cf1\insrsid6291856 5.5.2).}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  if one associates with a saintly}{\cf1\insrsid6291856  person, a devotee, hi}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 s path of liberation becomes clear. But if one associates with a woman}{\cf1\insrsid6291856 ,}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  or with a person who is too much addicted to a woman, his path of bondage becomes completely clear.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 
On the whole, for spiritual advancement, one must give up the company of women. This is what is meant by the order of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sanny\'e4sa,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the renounced order. Before taking }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sanny
\'e4sa,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or completely renouncing the material 
world, one has to practice avoiding illicit sex. Sex life, licit or illicit, is practically the same, but through illicit sex one becomes more and more captivated. By regulating one's sex life there is a chance that one may eventually be able to renounce 
sex or renounce the association of women. If this can be done, advancement in spiritual life comes very easily.
\par How one becomes captivated by the association of one's dear wife is explained in this chapter by N\'e4rada Muni. Attraction for one's wife means att
raction for the material qualities. One who is attracted by the material quality of darkness is in the lowest stage of life, whereas one who is attracted by the material quality of goodness is in a better position. Sometimes we see that when a person is o
n
 the platform of material goodness, he is attracted more or less by the cultivation of knowledge. This is, of course, a better position, for knowledge gives one the preference to accept devotional service. Unless one comes to the platform of knowledge, th
e }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 stage, one cannot advance in devotional service. As K\'e5\'f1\'eba says in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105 :
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahma-bh\'fcta\'f9 prasann\'e4tm\'e4\line na \'e7ocati na k\'e4\'eck\'f1ati\line sama
\'f9 sarve\'f1u bh\'fcte\'f1u\line mad-bhakti\'e0 labhate par\'e4m
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 "One who is thus transcendentally situated at once realizes the Supreme Brahman}{\cf1\insrsid8001455 .}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  He never laments nor desires to have anything; he is equally disposed to every living entity. In that state he attains pure devotional service unto Me."}{\cf1\insrsid8001455  }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid6291856\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{
\cf1\insrsid6291856 18.54)}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid8001455 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 The platform of knowledge is advantageous because it is a means by which on
e may come to the stage of devotional service. However, if one takes to devotional service directly, knowledge is revealed without separate endeavor. This is confirmed in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7r\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\insrsid8001455 : }{
\i\insrsid5197105\charrsid8001455 v\'e4sudeve bhagavati}{\i\insrsid8001455\charrsid8001455  }{\i\insrsid5197105\charrsid8001455 bhakti-yoga\'f9 prayojita\'f9}{\i\insrsid8001455\charrsid8001455 / }{\i\insrsid5197105\charrsid8001455 janayaty \'e4\'e7u vair
\'e4gya\'e0}{\i\insrsid8001455\charrsid8001455  }{\i\insrsid5197105\charrsid8001455 j\'ef\'e4na\'e0 ca yad ahaitukam}{\insrsid8001455  }{\insrsid8001455\charrsid8001455 (1.}{\insrsid8001455 2.7). }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
Devotional service automatically reveals actual knowledge of our material existence. One who is sufficiently intelligent immediately attains the stage of renunciation of so-called society, family and love as well as other 
things. As long as we are attached to society, family and love of the material world, there is no question of knowledge. Nor is there a question of devotional service. By directly taking to devotional service, however, one becomes filled with knowledge an
d renunciation. In this way one's life becomes successful.
\par }\pard\plain \s277\ql \li0\ri0\sb360\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 Thus end the Bhaktivedanta purports of the Fourth Canto, Twenty-fifth Chapter, of the }{
