[jae v]JaTYaDa" )) 8 ))
\par }\pard\plain \s23\qc \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs28\cf1\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 anyath\'e4 karma kurv\'e4\'ebo
\par m\'e4n\'e4r\'fc\'f2ho nibadhyate
\par gu\'eba-prav\'e4ha-patito
\par na\'f1\'f6a-praj\'efo vrajaty adha\'f9
\par }{\insrsid14643438 
