\'eba consciousness. When a person is initiated by a spiritual master, he changes his habits and does not eat undesirable eatables or engage in the eating of meat, the drinking of liquor, illicit sex or gambling. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 S\'e4ttvika-
\'e4h\'e4ra,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  foodstuffs in the mode of goodness, are described in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'e4stras}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  as wheat, rice, vegetables, fruits, milk, sugar, and milk products. Simple food like rice, }{
\cs337\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid11828970 dhal, c}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11828970 h}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid11828970 ap}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11828970 a}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid11828970 t}{\cs337\cf1\insrsid11828970 i}{
\cs337\cf1\insrsid5197105\charrsid11828970 s,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  vegetables, milk and sugar constitute a balanced diet, but sometimes it is found that an initiated person, in the name of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 pras\'e4da,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 eats very luxurious foodstuffs. Due to his past sinful life he becomes attracted by Cupid and eats good food voraciously. It is clearly visible that when a neophyte in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness eats too much, he falls down. Instead of being elevated to pure K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, he becomes attracted by Cupid. The so-called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 brahmac\'e4r\'e9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 becomes agitated by women, and the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 v\'e4naprastha}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 may again become captivated into having sex with his wife. Or he may begin to search out another wife. Due to some sentiment, he may give up his own wife and come int
o the association of devotees and a spiritual master, but due to his past sinful life he cannot stay. Instead of being elevated to K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, he falls down, being attracted by Cupid, and takes to another wife for sex enjoyment. The fall of the neophyte devotee from the path of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness down to material life is described in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7r
\'e9mad-Bh\'e4gavatam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  by N\'e4rada Muni.
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 tyaktv\'e4 sva-dharma\'e0 cara\'eb\'e4mbuja\'e0 harer\line 
