a consciousness receives no profit. One who comes to K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness must be very cautious and refrain from prohibited activities, as defined by R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 in his }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Upade\'e7\'e4m\'e5ta:
