ome happy, but when one becomes advanced in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, he does not derive happiness from material activities. This is explained in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{
