 Unfortunately, if the man becomes attracted to the woman simply for sex enjoyment, then family life becomes abominable.
\par The great politician C\'e4\'ebakya Pa\'eb\'f2ita has said: }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 bh\'e4ry\'e4 r\'fcpavat\'e9 \'e7atru\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 \emdash a beautiful wife is an enemy. Of course every woman in the eyes of
