ed to her. This attraction is the attraction of sex. The whole world is captivated by the two modes of material nature }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 rajo-gu\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 tamo-gu\'eba,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
