gnant, he is not allowed sex life at all. That is the law for human beings. A man is allowed to keep more than one wife because he cannot enjoy sex when the wife is pregnant. If he wants to enjoy sex at such a time, he may go to another wife who is not pr
egnant. These are laws mentioned in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Manu-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and other scriptures.
