ies. Illicit sex is sex that violates the laws given in the scriptures. When one violates the laws of the scriptures, or the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 he commits sinful activities. One who is engaged in sinful activities cannot change his consciousness. Our real function is to change our consciousness from }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ka\'e7mala,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  sinful consciousn}{
