 miser. A miser is one who gets money but does not spend it properly. This human form of life is especially meant for understanding Brahman, for becoming a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 and if we do not utilize it properly, we remain a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'e5pa\'eba.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  We can actually see that when one has money but does not spend it, he remains a miser and is never happy. Similarly, when one's intelli
gence is spoiled due to sense gratification, he remains a miser throughout his life.
