ter many, many years of enjoyment on the planets of the pious living entities, is born into a family of righteous people}{\cf1\insrsid1657353 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or into a family of rich aristocracy."}{\cf1\insrsid1657353  }{
\cs347\cf1\insrsid1657353\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid1657353 6.41)}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
