\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 
King Malayadhvaja was a great devotee, and after he married the daughter of King Vidarbha, he gave her one nice daughter, whose eyes were black. Figuratively this means that the daughter of King Malayadhvaja was }{\cf1\insrsid11881981 bestowed also}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  with devotional service, for her eyes were always fixed on K\'e5\'f1\'eba. A devotee has no vision in his life other than K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The seven sons are the seven processes of devotional service\emdash 
hearing, chanting, remembering, offering worship, offering prayers, rendering transcendental loving service and serving the lotus feet of the Lord. Of the nine types of devotional service, only seven were immediately given. The balance\emdash 
friendship and surrendering everything\emdash were to be developed later. In other words, devotional service is divided into two categories\emdash namely }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vidhi-m\'e4rga}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
r\'e4ga-m\'e4rga.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The process of becoming friends with the Lord and sacrificing everything for Him belongs to the category of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 r\'e4ga-m\'e4rga,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 the stage of developed devotional service. For the neophyte, the important processes are those of hearing and chanting (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtanam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ), remembering K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a, worshiping the Deity in the temple, offering prayers and always engaging in the service of the Lord, and worshiping the lotus feet of the Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 The word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yav\'e9yasa\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  indicates that 
these processes are very powerful. After a devotee engages in the processes of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtan}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid11881981 a\'e0 vi\'f1\'ebo\'f9 smara\'eba\'e0 p\'e4da-sevanam}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 arcana\'e0 vandana\'e0 }{\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 d\'e4sya}{\i\cf1\insrsid11881981 m}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and is able to secure these processes, he can later become a devotee capable of rendering spontaneous dev
otional service\emdash namely }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sakhyam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4tma-nivedanam.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Generally the great }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4c\'e4ryas}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 who preach devotional service all over the world belong to the category of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  A neophyte devotee cannot actually become a preacher. The neophyte is advised 
to execute devotional service in the seven other fields (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtanam,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 etc.). If one can successfully execute the preliminary seven items, he can in the future be situated on the platform of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam.
\par }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 The specific mention of Dravi\'f2a-de\'e7a refers to the five Dravi\'f2a-de\'e7as in }{\cf1\insrsid11881981 s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 outh India. All are very strong in rendering the preliminary devotional processes (}{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7rava\'eba\'e0 k\'e9rtanam}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 ). Some great }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4c\'e4ryas,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  like R\'e4m\'e4nuj\'e4c\'e4rya and Madhv\'e4c\'e4rya, also came from Dravi\'f2a-de\'e7
a and became great preachers. They were all situated on the platform of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sakhyam \'e4tma-nivedanam.
\par }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid2320539 
