}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 d\'e5\'f2ha-vrata,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the great vow, for when the mind is completely engaged in devotional service, the mind does not fall down. If one tries to advance by other means\emdash by }{
