sudeva extends everywhere as the impersonal Brahman. One cannot fix one's mind upon an impersonal "something." }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs347\cf1\insrsid14184656\charrsid14184656  }{
