 "For those whose minds are attached to the unmanifested, impersonal feature of the Supreme, advancement is very troublesome." }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid4326734\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid4326734 12.5) }{\cf1\insrsid11361097 Consequently}{
