a, is everything, and one who knows this is the greatest of all transcendentalists. It is stated in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\insrsid5197105 
 that one realizes this after many, many births. This is also confirmed in this verse with the words }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 divya\'e0 var\'f1a-\'e7atam}{\insrsid15866165  (}{\insrsid5197105 one hundred years according to t}{\insrsid15866165 
he calculations of the demigods}{\insrsid5197105 ). According to the calculations of the demigods, one day (twelve hours) is equal to six months on earth. A hundred years of the demigods would equal }{\insrsid15866165 36,000}{\insrsid5197105 
 earth years. Thus King Malayadhvaja executed austerities and penances for }{\insrsid15866165 36,000}{\insrsid5197105  years. After this 
time, he became fixed in the devotional service of the Lord. To live on earth for so many years, one has to take birth many times. This confirms the conclusion of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. To come to the conclusion of K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness and remain fixed in the realization that K\'e5\'f1\'eba is everything, as well as render service unto K\'e5\'f1\'eba, are characteristics of the perfectional stage. As said in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta}{
\insrsid5197105 : }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'e5\'f1\'ebe bhakti kaile sarva-karma k\'e5ta haya}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid15866165  }{\insrsid15866165 (Cc. }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid15866165 Madhya}{\insrsid15866165  22.62)}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 .}{
\insrsid5197105  When one comes to the conclusion that K\'e5\'f1\'eba is everything by worshiping or by rendering devotional service unto K\'e5\'f1\'eba, one actually becomes perfect in all respects. Not only must one come to the conclusion that K\'e5\'f1
\'eba is everything, but he must remain fixed in this realization. This is the highest perfection of life, and it is this perfection that King Malayadhvaja attained at the end.
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid2320539 
