 stage is exactly like this. Although the wife remains with the husband, she undergoes severe austerities and penances so that although both husb
and and wife live together, there is no question of sex. In this way both husband and wife can live together perpetually. Since the wife is weaker than the husband, this weakness is expressed in this verse with the words }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 
