"To those who are constantly devoted and worship Me with love, I give the understanding by which they can come to Me."}{\cf1\insrsid13842501  }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid13842501\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid13842501 10.10)}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
