sion of the spiritual master, he immediately associates with the Supreme Personality of Godhead by }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 v\'e4\'eb\'e9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 vapu\'f9.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 This is the only secret of success in seeing the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Instead of being eager to see the Lord in some bush of V\'e5nd\'e4v
ana while at the same time engaging in sense gratification, if one instead sticks to the principle of following the words of the spiritual master, he will see the Supreme Lord without difficulty. \'c7r\'e9la Bilvama\'ecgala \'d6h\'e4
kura has therefore said:
