\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 When a person's relative dies, renunciation is automatically visible. Consultation with the Su
persoul seated within everyone's heart is possible only when one is completely free from the contamination of material attachment. One who is sincere and pure gets an opportunity to consult with the Supreme Personality of Godhead in His Param\'e4tm\'e4
 feature sitting within everyone's heart. The Param\'e4tm\'e4 is always the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 caitya-guru,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 the spiritual master within, and He comes before one externally as the instructor and initiator spiritual master. The Lord can reside within the heart, and He can also come out before
 a person and give him instructions. Thus the spiritual master is not different from the Supersoul sitting within the heart. An uncontaminated soul or living entity can get a chance to meet the Param\'e4tm\'e4
 face to face. Just as one gets a chance to consult with th}{\cf1\insrsid13842501 e Param\'e4tm\'e4 within his heart, h}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
e also gets a chance to see Him actually situated before him. Then one can take instructions from the Supersoul directly. This is the duty of the pure devotee: to see the bona fide spiritual master and consult with the Supersoul within the heart.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 When the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 asked the woman who the man lying on the floor was, she answered that he was her spiritual master and that she was perplexed about what to do in his absence. At such a time the Supersoul immediately appears, pr
ovided the devotee is purified in heart by following the directions of the spiritual master. A sincere devotee who follows the instructions of the spiritual master certainly gets direct instructions from his heart from the Supersoul. Thus a sincere devote
e is always helped directly or indirectly by the spiritual master and the Supersoul. This is confirmed in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Caitanya-carit\'e4m\'e5ta:}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 guru-k\'e5\'f1\'eba-pras\'e4de p\'e4
ya bhakti-lat\'e4-b\'e9ja.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  If the devotee serves his spiritual master sincerely, K\'e5\'f1\'eba automatically becomes pleased. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Yasya pras\'e4d\'e4d bhagavad-pras\'e4da\'f9.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 By satisfying the spiritual master, one automatically satisfies K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Thus the devotee becomes enriched by both the spiritual master and K\'e5\'f1\'eba. The Supersoul is eternally the friend of the living entity and always rema
ins with him. The Supersoul has always been ready to help the living entity, even before the creation of this material world. It is therefore stated here: }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yen\'e4gre vicacartha.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The word }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 agre}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  means "before the creation." Thus the Supersoul has been accompanying the living entity since before the creation.
\par }{\cf1\insrsid2320539 
