ereas the original sun is very large. Vai\'f1\'eb
ava philosophers conclude that the living entity is simply a small sample of the original Supreme Personality of Godhead. Qualitatively, God and the living entities are one, but quantitatively the living entities a
re small fragments of the Supreme Personality of Godhead. The Supreme Lord is full, powerful and opulent. In the previous verse, the Lord says, "My dear friend, you and I are not different." This nondifference refers to qualitative oneness, for it was not
 necessary for the Param\'e4tm\'e4
, the Supreme Personality, to remind the conditioned soul that he is not one in quantity. The self-realized soul never thinks that he and the Supreme Personality of Godhead are one in every respect. Although he and the Supreme Pe
rsonality of Godhead are one in quality, the living entity is prone to forget his spiritual identity, whereas the Supreme Personality never forgets. This is the difference between }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 lipta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 alipta.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The Supreme Personality of Godhead is eternally }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 alipta,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  un
contaminated by the external energy. The conditioned soul, however, being in contact with material nature, forgets his real identity; therefore when he sees himself in the conditioned state, he identifies himself with the body. For the Supreme Personality
 of Godhead, however, there is no difference between the body and the soul. He is completely soul; He has no material body. Although the Supersoul, Param\'e4tm\'e4
, and the individual soul are both within the body, the Supersoul is devoid of designation, whereas the conditioned soul is designated by his particular type of body. The Supersoul is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 antary\'e4m\'e9,}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  and He is extensive. This is confirmed in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid2819058 :}{\cs347\cf1\insrsid14184656\charrsid14184656  }{
