ne can understand in truth the Supreme Personality of Godhead only when one is engaged in devotional service. Ordinary persons engaged in pious and impious activities cannot understand the form, nam
e and activities of the Lord. The devotee, however, can know the Personality of Godhead in many respects. He can understand that K\'e5\'f1\'eba is the Supreme Personality of Godhead, that His address is Goloka V\'e5nd\'e4
