\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid12936460 karm\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or fruitive actors. His form is described in }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Brahma-sa\'e0hit\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sac-cid-\'e4nanda-vigraha.}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  As confirmed by the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Padma Pur\'e4\'eba:
