 Supreme Personality of Godhead K\'e5\'f1\'eba}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  cannot be understood by the material senses, He is also called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 adhok\'f1aja,}{\cf1\insrsid12936460  meaning beyond sense perception.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 When the senses are purified by devotional activity, the devotee understands everything about the Lord by the Lord's grace. In this verse the words }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 pumbhir n\'e4mabhir v\'e4 kriy\'e4-gu\'ebai\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 are especially significant because God, K\'e5\'f1\'eba, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, has many names, activities and qualities, although none of them are material. Despite the fact that all these names, activities and pastimes are mentioned in the 
}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'e4stras}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and understood by the devotees, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karm\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  (fruitive laborers) cannot understand them. Nor can the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 j\'ef
\'e4n\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  (mental speculators) understand them. Although there are thousands of names of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karm\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 j\'ef\'e4n\'e9s}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  intermingle the names of the Supreme Godhead with the names of demigods and human beings. Because they cannot understand the actual name of the Supreme Personality of Godhead, they
 take for granted that any name can be accepted. They believe that since the Absolute Truth is impersonal, they can call Him by any name. Otherwise, they maintain, He has no name. This is not a fact. Here it is clearly stated: }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 n\'e4mabhir v\'e4 kriy\'e4-gu\'ebai\'f9.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The Lord has specific names such as R\'e4ma, K\'e5\'f1\'eba, Govinda, N\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba, Vi\'f1\'ebu and Adhok\'f1
aja. There are indeed many names, but the conditioned soul cannot understand them.
