vana. From the external point of view, it can be concluded that V\'e5nd\'e4vana has become degenerate due to these }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sahajiy\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  activities, yet from the spiritual point of view, V\'e5nd\'e4
