 be happy. In actuality, however, when he comes to that point, he sees that there is no happiness. He then plans to go further and further to another point. This is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e5ga-t\'e5\'f1\'eb\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 and its basis is sense enjoyment in this material world.
