\par }\pard\plain \s124\qj \fi360\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 Actually the living entity is part and parcel of the Lord; th
erefore he is spiritual in quality. The living entity is never material, and his material conception is simply a mistake due to forgetfulness. He is as brilliant as the Supreme Personality of Godhead. Both the sun and the sunshine are very brilliant. The 
Lord is like the full shining sun, and the living entities are like the small particles of that sun which constitute the all-pervasive sunshine. When these small particles are covered by the cloud of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4,}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  they lose their shining capacity. When the cloud of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  is gone, the particles again become brilliant and shining. As soon as the living entity is covered by the ignorance of 
}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid12587895 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or darkness, he cannot understand his relationship with the Supreme God. Somehow or other, if he comes before the Lord, he can
 see himself as shining as the Supreme Lord, although he is not as extensive as the Lord. Because the living entity desires to imitate the Supreme Lord, he is covered by }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 We cannot imitate the Lord, nor can we become the supreme enjoyer. This is not possible, and when we think it is, we become conditioned by }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 Thus the encagement of the living entity under the clutches of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  is brought about by forgetfulness of his relationship with the Supreme Lord.
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 Under the influence of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 the living entity becomes exactly like a person haunted by a ghost. Such a person speaks all kinds of nonsense. When the living entity is covered by the influence of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 he becomes a so-called scientist, philosopher, politician or socialist, and at every moment presents 
different plans for the benefit of human society. All these plans are ultimately failures because they are illusory. In this way the living entity forgets his position as an eternal servant of the Lord. He instead becomes a servant of }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  In any case he remains a servant. It is his misfortune that by forgetting his real contact with the Supreme Lord, he becomes a servant of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  As servant of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  he sometimes becomes a king, sometimes an ordinary citizen, sometimes a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 br\'e4hma\'eba,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  a }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e7\'fcdra,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and so on. Sometimes he is a happy man, sometimes a prosperous man, sometimes a small insect. Sometimes he is in heaven}{\cf1\insrsid12587895 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 and sometimes in hell. Sometimes he is a demigod, and sometimes he is a demon. Sometimes he is a servant, and sometimes he is a master. In this way the
 living entity wanders all over the universe. Only when he comes in contact with the bona fide spiritual master can he understand his real constitutional position. He then becomes disgusted with material existence. At that time, in full K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, he regrets his past experiences in material existence. This regret is very beneficial because it purifie}{\cf1\insrsid12587895 s the living entity of material}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 conditional life. He then prays to the Lord to engage in His service, and}{\cf1\insrsid12587895 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  at that time, K\'e5\'f1\'eba grants liberation from the clutches of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eba explains this in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 :
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 daiv\'e9 hy e\'f1\'e4 gu\'eba-may\'e9\line mama m\'e4y\'e4 duratyay\'e4\line m\'e4
m eva ye prapadyante\line m\'e4y\'e4m et\'e4\'e0 taranti te
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 "This divine energy of Mine, consisting of the three modes of material nature, is difficult to overcome
. But those who have surrendered unto Me can easily cross beyond it."}{\cf1\insrsid12587895  }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid12587895\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid12587895 7.14)}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
