\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  It is not possible to get out by mental speculation or other activities. When the living entity understands his real position by the grace of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, he keeps himself always fit in K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness and acts accordingly. Thus he gradually becomes completely free from the clutches of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  When he is strong in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y
\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  cannot touch him. In this way, in the association of K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious devotees, the living entity can get free from the contamination of material existence. In this connection, \'c7r\'e9la K\'e5\'f1\'ebad\'e4sa Kavir\'e4
ja Gosv\'e4m\'e9 says:
