er he is freed, and his attraction becomes fixed. Then real devotion and devotional service begin." }{\i\cf1\insrsid16085486\charrsid16085486 (Bh\'e4g.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 3.25.25) In the association of pure devotees, one becomes attached to hearing and chanting the glories of the Lord. In this way one can cultivate K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness, and as soon as this cultivation is advanced, one can become faithful to the Lord, devoted to the Lord and attached to the Lord, and thus one can very quickly attain full K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. The secret of success in the cultivation of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness is hearing from the right person. A K\'e5\'f1\'eba conscious person is never disturbed by the bodily necessities\emdash namely}{\cf1\insrsid4544355 ,}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  eating, sleeping, mating and defending.
\par }{\cf1\insrsid2320539 
