n be understood not by advanced knowledge, but by pure devotional service, as confirmed in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid6426078 :}{
