e real purpose of life. The real purpose of life is to go back home, back to Godhead. Ignorant of the real purpose of life, people take to either gross materialistic activities or ritualistic activities. King Barhi\'f1m\'e4
n is herein requested not to be attached to such activities. In the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  it is stated that the performance of sacrifice is the actual purpose of life. A section of the Indian population known as the 
\'c4rya-sam\'e4jists lay too much stress on the sacrificial portion of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  This verse indicate
s, however, that such sacrifices are to be taken as illusory. Actually the aim of human life should be God realization, or K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a consciousness. The Vedic performances are, of course, very glittering and pleasing to hear about, but they do not serve the real purpose of life.
