My dear King, woman, who is very attractive in the beginning but in the end very disturbing, is exactly like the flower, which is attractive in the beginning and detestable at the end. With woman, the living entity }{\fs28\insrsid6312937 
is entangled with lusty desires and}{\fs28\insrsid1317567  sex.}{\fs28\insrsid5197105  He thus enjoys a life of sense gratification\emdash from his tongue to his genitals\emdash 
and in this way the living entity considers himself very happy in family life. United with his wife, he always remains absorbed in such thoughts. He feels great p
leasure in hearing the talks of his wife and children, which are like the sweet humming of bumblebees that collect honey from flower to flower. He forgets that before him is time, which is taking away his life-span with the passing of day and night. He do
es not see the gradual diminishing of his life, nor does he care about the superintendent of death, who is trying to kill him from behind. Just try to understand this. You are in a precarious position and are threatened from all sides.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10443382 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid10443382\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
