r planet. He thus enjoys the results of the actions of his past life.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10443382 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid10443382\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
