en at the point of death he abhors leaving his present body. Sometimes it is found that a person on the verge of death remains in a coma for many days before giving up the body. This is common among so-called leaders and politicians who think that without
 their presence the entire country and all society will be in chaos. This is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
