d being attracted by one another. However, when one fully understands spiritual life, his attraction for the opposite sex is completely vanquished. By such attraction, one becomes overly attached to this material world. It is a hard knot within the heart.

\par }\pard\plain \s293\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid2573617 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 pu\'e0sa\'f9 striy\'e4 mithun\'e9-bh\'e4vam eta\'e0\line tayor mitho h\'e5
