\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yoga}{\cf1\insrsid10891893  means }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 acting on behalf of the }{\cf1\insrsid10891893 Supreme Personality of Godhead.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  As confirmed by }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{
