 and so on. He also wants to enjoy the heavenly planets after the annihilation of the body. If one is engaged in devotional }{\cf1\highlight7\insrsid5197105\charrsid2961063 ser}{\cf1\highlight7\insrsid2961063\charrsid2961063 i}{
