ment, uncontaminated by the material modes of nature, he becomes fit to return home, back to Godhead. Although by special blessing the Pracet\'e4
s would enjoy material facilities for millions of years, they would not be attached to them. Thus at the end of their material enjoyment they would be promoted to the spiritual world and return to Godhead.
\par The word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 pakva-gu\'eb\'e4\'e7ay\'e4\'f9}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  has special significance, for it means that by devotional service one is able to give up the influence of the three modes of material natur
e. As long as one is influenced by the modes of material nature, he cannot return to Godhead. It is clearly explained that all planets in the material world\emdash beginning from Brahmaloka down to the hellish planets\emdash 
are unfit places for a devotee. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid2047312 Pada\'e0 pada\'e0 yad vipad\'e4\'e0 na te\'f1\'e4m}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 .}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 A place where there is danger at every step is certainly not a comfortable place. The Lord therefore says in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 :
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e4brahma-bhuvan\'e4l lok\'e4\'f9\line punar \'e4vartino 'rjuna\line m\'e4
m upetya tu kaunteya\line punar janma na vidyate
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 "From the highest pl
