tad-artha\'e0 karma kaunteya\line mukta-sa\'ecga\'f9 sam\'e4cara
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1006505 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 
One who tries to enjoy the results of his activities becomes bound by the results. One who offers the results or profits to the Supreme Personality of Godhead, however, does not become entangled in the results. This is the secret of success.
 Generally people take }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sanny\'e4sa}{\insrsid5197105 
 to become free from the reactions of fruitive activity. One who does not receive the results of his actions but offers them instead to the Supreme Personality of Godhead certainly remains in a liberated condition. In }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhakti-
ras\'e4m\'e5ta-sindhu,}{\insrsid5197105  \'c7r\'e9 R\'fcpa Gosv\'e4m\'e9 confirms this:
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e9h\'e4 yasya harer d\'e4sye\line karma\'eb\'e4 manas\'e4 gir\'e4\line nikhil\'e4
sv apy avasth\'e4su\line j\'e9van-mukta\'f9 sa ucyate
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 If one engages himself in the service of the Lord through his life, wealth, words, intelligence}{
\insrsid15475610 ,}{\insrsid5197105  and everything he possesses, he will always be liberated in any condition. Such a person is called a }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 j\'e9van-mukta,}{\insrsid5197105 
 one who is liberated during this lifetime. Devoid of K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness, those who engage in material activities simply become more entangled in material bondage. They have to suffer and enjoy the actions and reactions of all activity. This K
\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness movement is therefore the greatest boon to humanity because it keeps one always engaged in K\'e5\'f1\'eba's service. The devotees think of K\'e5\'f1\'eba, act for K\'e5\'f1\'eba, eat for K\'e5\'f1\'eba, sleep for K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a and work for K\'e5\'f1\'eba. Thus everything is engaged in the service of K\'e5\'f1\'eba. A total life in K\'e5\'f1\'eba consciousness saves one from material contamination. As stated by Bhaktisiddh\'e4nta Sarasvat\'e9 Gosv\'e4m\'e9 Mah\'e4r\'e4ja:}{
\insrsid15475610  }{\i\insrsid15475610\charrsid15475610 k\'e5\'f1\'eba-bhajane y\'e4h\'e4 haya anuk\'fcla, vi\'f1aya baliy\'e4 ty\'e4ge t\'e4h\'e4 haya bh\'fcla.}{\i\insrsid15475610  }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
If one is so expert that he can engage everything or dovetail everything in the service of the Lord, to give up the material world would be a great blunder. One should learn how to dovetail everything in the serv
ice of the Lord, for everything is connected to K\'e5\'f1\'eba. That is the real purpose of life and secret of success. As reiterated later in the Third Chapter of }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t
\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 :
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 tasm\'e4d asakta\'f9 satata\'e0\line k\'e4rya\'e0 karma sam\'e4cara\line asakto hy \'e4
caran karma\line param \'e4pnoti p\'fcru\'f1a\'f9
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 
"Therefore, without being attached to the fruits of activities, one should act as a matter of duty; for by working without attachment, one attains the Supreme."}{\cf1\insrsid15475610  }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid15475610\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{
