Supersoul within the heart of the devotee, makes everything increasingly fresh. This is known as the Brahman position by the advocates of the Absolute Truth. In such a liberated stage [brahma-bh\'fc
ta], one is never bewildered. Nor does one lament or become unnecessarily jubilant. This is due to the brahma-bh\'fcta situation.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10443382 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid10443382\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
