\insrsid5197105 \emdash whose brain works only for the deliverance of the conditioned soul; }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 v\'e4sudev\'e4ya}{\insrsid5197105 \emdash the all-pervading Supreme Personality of Godhead; }{\cs337\i\insrsid5197105 k\'e5\'f1\'eb\'e4ya
