itation broken. Although he was offering food to the Lord within his mind, the Lord accept}{\cf1\insrsid9337538 ed it nonetheless. Consequently}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the Lord in Vaiku\'eb\'f6ha immediately sent a chariot to bring the }{
