ion because You are the Supreme beyond all transcendence}{\fs28\insrsid5197105  and because there is no end }{\fs28\insrsid10748191 to Your opulences. Consequently}{\fs28\insrsid5197105  You are celebrated by the name Ananta.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10443382 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid10443382\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
