 tree, it gets unlimited supplies of honey. There is no need to go to another tree. If one is fixed in the service of the lotus feet of the Lord, there is unlimited transcendental bliss, and as such there is no need to ask for further benediction. The }{
\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  tree is not commonly found within this material world. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  tree is also known as }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 kalpa-v\'e5k
\'f1a,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  or the wish-fulfilling tree. One can get a
nything he desires from such a tree. In the material world, one can get oranges from an orange tree or mangoes from a mango tree, but there is no possibility of getting oranges from a mango tree or vice versa. However, one can get whatever he wants from t
he }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  tree\emdash oranges, mangoes, bananas}{\cf1\insrsid10713317 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  and so on. This tree is found in the spiritual world. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Cint\'e4ma\'eb
i-prakara-sadmasu kalpa-v\'e5k\'f1a-lak\'f1\'e4v\'e5te\'f1u.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  The spiritual world, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 cint\'e4ma\'ebi-dh\'e4ma,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  is surrounded by these }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 kalpa-v\'e5k\'f1a}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  trees, but the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  tree is also found in the kingdom of Indra, that is, on Indra's heavenly planet. This }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 
 tree was brought by K\'e5\'f1\'eba to please Satyabh\'e4m\'e4, one of His queens, and this tree was implanted in the Dv\'e4rak\'e4 mansions constructed for the queens. The lotus feet of the Lord are exactly like the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 p\'e4rij
\'e4ta}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  trees, or wish-fulfilling trees, and the devotees are like bumblebees. They are always attracted by the lotus feet of the Lord.
