\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'e5ti\'e0}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105  taranti.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  Without taking shelter of the lotus feet of the Personality of Godhead, one cannot attain relief from the clutches of }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 m\'e4y\'e4,}{
\cf1\insrsid5197105  the repetition of birth, old age, disease and death. The Pracet\'e4s received the shelter of the Supreme Personality of Godhead by the grace of Lord \'c7iva. Lord \'c7iva is the supreme devotee of Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u, the Supreme Personality of Godhead. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vai\'f1\'ebav\'e4n\'e4\'e0 yath\'e4 \'e7ambhu\'f9:}{\cf1\insrsid15285009  T}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 he most exalted Vai\'f1\'ebava is Lord \'c7iva, and those who are actually dev
otees of Lord \'c7iva follow Lord \'c7iva's advice and take shelter at the lotus feet of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. The }{\cf1\insrsid15285009 so-called devotees of Lord \'c7iva}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  who are simply after materia}{\cf1\insrsid15285009 l prosperity}
{\cf1\insrsid5197105  are in a way deceived by Lord \'c7iva. He does not actually deceive them, because Lord \'c7iva has no business deceiving people, but because the so-called devotees of Lord \'c7iva want to be deceived, Lord \'c7
iva, who is very easily pleased, allows them all kinds of material benedictions. These benedictions might ironically result in the destruction of the so-called devotees. For instance, R\'e4va\'eba took all material benediction from Lord \'c7
iva, but the result was that he was ultimately destroyed with his family, kingdom and everything else because he misused Lord \'c7iva's benediction. Because of his mater
ial power, he became very proud and puffed up so that he dared kidnap the wife of Lord R\'e4macandra. In this way he was ruined. To get material benedictions from Lord \'c7iva is not difficult, but actually these are not benedictions. The Pracet\'e4
s received benediction from Lord \'c7iva, and as a result they attained the shelter of the lotus feet of Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. This is real benediction. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  also worshiped Lord \'c7iva in V\'e5nd
\'e4vana, and the lord is still staying there as Gop\'e9\'e7vara. The }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 gop\'e9s,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  however, prayed that Lord \'c7iva bless them by giving them Lord K\'e5\'f1\'eb
a as their husband. There is no harm in worshiping the demigods, provided that one's aim is to return home, back to Godhead. Generally people go to the demigods for material benefit, as indicated in }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Bhagavad-}{
\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid8601574\charrsid8601574 g\'e9t\'e4}{\cf1\insrsid5197105 :
\par }\pard\plain \s302\qc \li0\ri0\sb180\sa180\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \i\f35\fs24\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\fs28\cf1\insrsid5197105 k\'e4mais tais tair h\'e5ta-j\'ef\'e4n\'e4\'f9\line prapadyante 'nya-devat\'e4\'f9\line 
ta\'e0 ta\'e0 niyamam \'e4sth\'e4ya\line prak\'e5ty\'e4 niyat\'e4\'f9 svay\'e4
\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 
"Those whose minds are distorted by material desires surrender unto demigods and follow the particular rules and regulations of worship according to their own natures." }{\cs347\cf1\insrsid1850152\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid1850152 7.20) 
\par }\pard\plain \s216\qj \fi357\li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid1850152 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\insrsid5197105 One enamored by material benefits is called }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 h\'e5ta j\'ef
\'e4na}{\insrsid1850152  (}{\insrsid5197105 on}{\insrsid1850152 e who has lost his intelligence}{\insrsid5197105 ). In this connection it is to be noted that sometimes in revealed scriptures Lord \'c7iva is described as being nondifferent from the Supreme
 Personality of Godhead. The point is that Lord \'c7iva and Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu are so intimately connected that there is no difference in opinion. The actual fact is, }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ekale \'e9\'e7vara k\'e5\'f1\'eba, \'e4ra saba bh\'e5tya:}{
\insrsid5197105  "The only supreme master is K\'e5\'f1\'eba, and all others are His devotees or servants." (Cc. }{\cs347\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c4di}{\insrsid5197105  5.142) This is the real fact, and there is no difference of opinion between Lord \'c7
iva and Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu in this connection. Nowhere in revealed scripture does Lord \'c7iva claim to be equal to Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu. This is simply the creation of the so-called devotees of Lord \'c7iva, who claim that Lord \'c7iva and Lord Vi\'f1\'eb
u are one. This is strictly forbidden in the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid1850152 v}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 ai\'f1\'ebava-tantra:}{\insrsid5197105  }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 yas tu n\'e4r\'e4ya\'eba\'e0 devam.}{\insrsid5197105  Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu, Lord 
\'c7iva and Lord Brahm\'e4 are intimately connected as master and servants. }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 \'c7iva-viri\'efci-nutam.}{\insrsid5197105  Vi\'f1\'ebu is honored and offered obeisances by Lord \'c7iva and Lord Brahm\'e4
. To consider that they are all equal is a great offense. They are all equal in the sense that Lord Vi\'f1\'ebu is the Supreme Personality of Godhead and all others are His eternal servants.
