\par }\pard\plain \s31\qj \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \f35\fs28\lang2057\langfe2057\cgrid\langnp2057\langfenp2057 {\cf1\insrsid5197105 "If one offers Me with love and devotion a leaf, a flower, fruit or water, I will accept it." }{
\cs347\cf1\insrsid5340652\charrsid14184656 (Bg. }{\cf1\insrsid5340652 9.26) }{\cf1\insrsid5197105 Thus there are restrictions for the advanced \'c4ryans. Although the Lord Himself can eat anything and everything, He }{\cf1\insrsid5340652 nonetheless }{
