iva, cannot fully understand Your glories and potencies. Nonetheless they have offered their pra
yers according to their own capacities. In the same way, we, although much lower than these personalities, also offer our prayers according to our own capability.
\par }\pard \s289\qc \fi360\li0\ri0\sb36\sa36\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0\pararsid10443382 {\fs28\cf11\insrsid10443382\charrsid3754542 PURPORT
