\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  There are many M\'e4y\'e4v\'e4d\'e9 }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 sanny\'e4s\'e9s}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  fully engaged in studying the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas, Ved\'e4nta-s\'fctra}{
