se in studying all the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid3742636 ,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  if one cannot grasp the essence of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 Vedas,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  K\'e5\'f1\'eba? The Lord confirms in }{
