\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 mah\'e4-mantra,}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  but their purpose is different from that of the }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 bhaktas.}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  In all processes\emdash }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 karma, j\'ef\'e4na}{
