\cf1\insrsid5197105  }{\cf1\insrsid2383666 (}{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid2383666 janm\'e4dy asya yata\'f9) }{\cs337\cf1\insrsid2383666 that}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the creation, maintenance and dissolution of this cosmic manifestation are due to the existence o}{
\cf1\insrsid2383666 f the Supreme Lord. Nonetheless}{\cf1\insrsid5197105  the Lord is unaffected by all these changes in the material elements. This is indicated by the word }{\cs337\i\cf1\insrsid5197105 prav\'e4ha}{\cf1\insrsid2383666  (emanation}{
